    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      520.75,
      534.05,
      616.99
    ],
    "text": "Rainy conditions are expected to be enhance in the southwestern parts of the island from tomorrow (02 June) evening. Showers will occur at times in Western, Sabaragamuwa and North-western provinces and in Galle, Matara, Kandy and Nuwara-Eliya districts. Fairly heavy falls about 75 mm are likely at some places in these areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      620.65,
      533.91,
      660.58
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers may occur at a few places in Uva province and in Ampara and Batticaloa districts after 1.00 pm.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Iskoola Pota"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      664.24,
      533.8,
      719.5
    ],
    "text": "Fairly strong winds about (30-40) kmph can be expected at times over Western slopes of the central hills, Northern, North-central, North-western and Southern provinces and in Trincomalee district.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.32,
      722.02,
      534.05,
      763.06
    ],
    "text": "The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
